     Search Console) also finds the city sky pages. sitemap-pages.xml: the site's own pages, dated from git at each build.
     sitemap-sky.xml: every "What's in the sky tonight in <city>" page, written by brand/tools/make_sky_pages.mjs at each
     build over the stand-in committed here (which names only the two lists). -->
<sitemapindex xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <sitemap><loc>https://destinjones.github.io/open-overwatch/sitemap-pages.xml</loc></sitemap>
  <sitemap><loc>https://destinjones.github.io/open-overwatch/sitemap-sky.xml</loc></sitemap>
</sitemapindex>
